> look into gating it by size

i've always wondered why we don't cap the size of the application receive buffer `(m_recv_buffer`) and then let the rest of the data that doesn’t fit yet stay in the kernel buffers in the meantime.  

@pinheadmz any tradeoffs in doing this?

